---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, PHONE, PHONE_TEL } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={`Clog Removal & Drain Repair Santa Clarita | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Fast clog removal and drain repair in Santa Clarita, CA. Emergency service available for stubborn backups and recurring drain problems." />
</head>
<body>
	<Header />

	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Clog Removal & Drain Repair</h1>
			<p>Quick diagnosis and lasting solutions for stubborn clogs and recurring drain problems.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="content-grid">
				<div>
					<h2>When a Simple Clean Isn’t Enough</h2>
					<p>Some clogs return because the underlying cause — grease buildup, hair mats, foreign objects, or early root intrusion — wasn’t fully addressed. Our clog removal and repair service goes beyond a temporary opening to identify and resolve the root issue whenever possible.</p>
					<p>We also provide emergency response for overflowing toilets, backed-up sinks, and main line issues that need same-day attention.</p>
					
					<h3>What We Address</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Recurring kitchen and bathroom clogs</li>
						<li>Foreign objects stuck in lines</li>
						<li>Partial blockages that slow multiple fixtures</li>
						<li>Emergency backups and overflows</li>
						<li>Minor drain line repairs accessible without major excavation</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>Our Approach</h3>
					<p>We start with a clear assessment. When helpful, we use camera inspection to see exactly what’s happening inside the pipe. Then we select the most effective clearing method and, if needed, recommend targeted repairs so the problem doesn’t keep coming back.</p>
					
					<h3>Emergency Service</h3>
					<p>Drain emergencies don’t wait for business hours. Call us for urgent situations — we prioritize true backups and will advise you on immediate steps while we’re on the way.</p>
					
					<div class="mt-2">
						<a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Request Service</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Deal with That Clog Today</h2>
			<p>Call for prompt clog removal and repair in Santa Clarita.</p>
			<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {PHONE}</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Footer />
</body>
</html>
